<section id="about" class="relative py-24 px-[5%] max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
  <h2 class="section-title font-serif text-5xl font-normal text-blue-black text-center mb-16 relative">
    About
    <span class="block mt-4 text-blush text-xl opacity-60">✦</span>
  </h2>
  
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center mb-16">
    <div class="about-image w-full h-[500px] rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden border-2 border-olive/20">
      <span class="absolute bottom-5 right-5 text-8xl opacity-[0.08]">🌿</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-text">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-olive mb-6 font-normal">Welcome</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-blue text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        I believe healing happens when we reconnect with our most authentic selves and the natural world around us. My practice integrates traditional therapeutic approaches with nature-based wisdom, creating a space where transformation unfolds organically.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-blue text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Drawing from the rhythms of the Pacific Northwest landscape, I help clients navigate life's challenges with gentleness and intention. Whether you're processing grief, exploring identity, or seeking deeper meaning, you'll find a compassionate witness here.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-blue text-lg leading-relaxed">
        My approach honors the cyclical nature of healing—just as the forest transforms through seasons, so too do we grow through periods of darkness and light.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-image {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212, 165, 165, 0.15) 0%, rgba(107, 124, 93, 0.12) 100%);
  }

  .about-image::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image: 
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(107, 124, 93, 0.02) 2px, rgba(107, 124, 93, 0.02) 4px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(107, 124, 93, 0.02) 2px, rgba(107, 124, 93, 0.02) 4px);
  }

  section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.03;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    top: -100px;
    right: -150px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, theme('colors.olive') 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
</style>
